    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This disk or disks contains a file or files of NURE (National Uranium Resource Evaluation) data, and/or RASS (Rock Analysis Storage System) data, a text file describing the data, a\r\nconversion program (STP2DAT.EXE), and this readme.1st file. The text and data files are named for the 2-degree quadrangle. The file naming convention is quadrangle-name.rep for the text, quadrangle-name.nur for NURE data, and quadrangle-name.ras for RASS data. The data files are in a STATPAC binary format. STATPAC conversion program and related programs for IBM-personal computers are described in Grundy and Miesch, 1987.\"",
            "type": "abstract",
